<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala buys 112 ha lot from foreclosed bank.</title>
<headline>Ayala buys 112 ha lot from foreclosed bank.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Land Inc said on Tuesday it had bought 112 hectares of land in the industrial Cavite province from the foreclosed Manila Banking Corp.</p>
<p>The purchase was approved by the Philippine central bank, receiver of the Manila Banking Corp which declared insolvency.</p>
<p>Ayala did not disclose other details of the purchase.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
